@Neumann-A @strega-nil Thank you very much for your hard work, I am trying to learn this so I can make changes/patches and submit the PR instead of just creating issues.

- I think that is what is so confusing to me, port libzippp has `[vcpkg-root]\buildtrees\libzippp\src\32217e672c-26e2865e9c.clean\FindLIBZIP.cmake` and in turn looks like it has all the compression libraries in it for windows builds, but it does not look like the oncre created on Linux builds.
- It is more fun to research, find the problem then especially rewarding to fix the problem instead of depending on someone else. It is like a puzzle to be solved.
